+/// 論点3: 先獅子の記録がある局面で、獅子が隣接する獅子Aと隣接しない獅子Bを取る手（第15条、第16条）。
+#[test]
+fn reading_3_lion_takes_two_lions_under_the_recapture_ban() {
+    for record in [true, false] {
+        let mut builder = PositionBuilder::new(Color::Black);
+        let pieces = [
+            (sq(5, 5), unpromoted(Color::Black, PieceKind::Lion)),
+            (sq(6, 6), unpromoted(Color::White, PieceKind::Lion)),
+            (sq(7, 7), PieceCode::new_promoted(Color::White, PieceKind::Lion).unwrap()),
+            (sq(6, 7), unpromoted(Color::White, PieceKind::GoldGeneral)),
+            (sq(2, 2), unpromoted(Color::White, PieceKind::Rook)),
+            (sq(0, 0), unpromoted(Color::Black, PieceKind::King)),
+            (sq(11, 11), unpromoted(Color::White, PieceKind::King)),
+        ];
+        for (square, piece) in pieces {
+            builder.put(square, piece).unwrap();
+        }
+        let mut position = builder.finish().unwrap();
+        if record {
+            position.set_lion_capture(Some(sq(2, 2))).unwrap();
+        }
+        for set in ["L0,P0,R1,E0", "L0,L4,P0,R1,E0", "L1,P0,R1,E0"] {
+            let generator = MoveGenerator::new(rules(set).moves);
+            println!(
+                "reading3 record={record} {set}: take_a={} igui_a={} a_then_b={} jump_to_b={} a_then_empty={}",
+                legal(&generator, &position, mv((5, 5), None, (6, 6), false)),
+                legal(&generator, &position, mv((5, 5), Some((6, 6)), (5, 5), false)),
+                legal(&generator, &position, mv((5, 5), Some((6, 6)), (7, 7), false)),
+                legal(&generator, &position, mv((5, 5), None, (7, 7), false)),
+                legal(&generator, &position, mv((5, 5), Some((6, 6)), (7, 6), false))
+            );
+        }
+    }
+}
